/-
Proofs of the mathematical properties behind the algorithms in thole.

Each area gets a module `Thole.<Area>` that mirrors a Rust crate
(`Thole.Roots` for `thole-roots`, and so on). Import every module here so
that `lake build` checks all of them.

What these proofs cover, and what they do not, is stated in CONCEPT.md
section 3.5.
-/
